   "order_in_parent": 3,
   "parent_unit_id": null,
   "unit_id": "718b97a8006ac45ecc62",
   "char_count": 407,
   "pair_ref": null
  },
  {
   "unit_type": "entry",
   "text": "H02 催乳/增产/奶量产出承诺（含裸 more milk、催产素、长期奶量、裸奶阵/排空功效claim，无 FDA/临床证据）；放松叙事+限定语（natural let-down/may help）走 M07 语境守卫；H07 疼痛功效承诺（pain-free/no pain/without pain/pain relief/less pain/缓解疼痛等；吸奶疼痛因人而异，只可讲 comfort/gentle 舒适与缓解胀满不适 discomfort）；M01 静音程度夸大（建议改为 low noise / quiet mode）",
